    64	<p>The €52,000 is not “a camera.” It includes the partner’s conveyor changes, guarded reject, wiring, PLC program, risk assessment work, installation and first response. If a standard printer-linked camera solves the job for materially less, the proposal loses and should lose. The €9,500 contribution is only 18% of the end-customer price—27% of wholesale revenue—and two revisits can erase it. The acceptance test and physical interfaces must therefore prevent open-ended commissioning.</p>
